==English==
{{wikipedia|dab=pharmacy (disambiguation)|pharmacy}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|pharmacy}}, borrowed from {{der|en|frm|pharmacie}}, from {{der|en|fro|farmacie}}, from {{der|en|ML.|pharmacia}}, from {{der|en|grc|φαρμακεία||the use of drugs}}, from {{m|grc|φάρμακον||a drug, charm, enchantment}}, of uncertain but likely {{der|en|pregrc|-}} origin.

Attested since late 14th century.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|GenAm}} {{enPR|fär'məsē}} {{IPA|en|/ˈfɑɹməsi/}}
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|en|/ˈfɑːməsi/}}
* {{audio|en|En-us-pharmacy.ogg|Audio (US)}}
* {{audio|en|En-uk-pharmacy.ogg|Audio (UK)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{qualifier|countable}} A place where [[prescription]] drugs are [[dispensed]]; a [[dispensary]].
# {{qualifier|uncountable}} The science of medicinal substances comprising [[pharmaceutics]], [[pharmaceutical]] [[chemistry]], [[pharmacology]], [[phytochemistry]] and [[forensics]].
# {{qualifier|uncountable}} The occupation of a [[pharmacist]].

====Related terms====
* {{l|en|pharmacist}}
* {{l|en|pharmacology}}

